meta {
  name: Extract Receipt Image
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/receipts/extract-image
  body: multipartForm
  auth: none
}

body:multipartForm {
  file: @{{receiptImagePath}}
  testcaseId: {{imageTestcaseId}}
}

docs {
  POST /api/v1/receipts/extract-image — vision path.

  Sends a receipt photo as media to a vision-capable extractor model —
  no OCR pre-pass. Point EXTRACTOR_MODEL at a vision model if the
  default isn't one (gpt-4o is). PNG / JPEG / WebP, up to 10 MB.

  Set receiptImagePath in the Local environment (or edit the body
  below) to a real receipt image path relative to this collection.
  A photo of the rcpt-001 konbini receipt works well.

  Privacy: pixels cannot be regex-scrubbed — the model reads any card
  numbers printed on the photo. The pipeline scrubs transcribed PII
  before it reaches span attributes; set
  CHAT_COMPLETION_TELEMETRY=false on the app for zero PII in
  telemetry.

  Response carries X-Trace-Id / X-Span-Id headers like the text path.
}
